PUPPET WORKSHOP -- MAINTENANCE FILE: KANKURO'S PUPPET CORPS
Puppet Brigade, master's private log (Workshop copy)

Kankuro of the Sand Siblings maintains one of the deadliest puppet arsenals in
the village. This file tracks the upkeep of his registered puppets.

Registered puppets under care:
- Crow (Karasu) -- multi-armed, blade-and-senbon frame. Poison launchers checked
  each cycle; reservoirs refilled from Poison Division stock only.
- Black Ant (Kuroari) -- capture puppet, hollow torso for trapping a target.
  Locking mechanism inspected for sand fouling.
- Salamander (Sanshouo) -- heavy defensive puppet with armored shell; joints
  re-oiled against abrasion.

Standing notes: Kankuro's mastery lies in combining puppets -- driving a target
into Black Ant's body, then skewering it through with Crow's blades. All hidden
poison is fast-acting; handlers glove up and log every refill. Following his near
-fatal poisoning by Sasori, Kankuro adopted stricter reservoir seals. Filed to
the Workshop under Brigade authority.
